PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro::
    .string "So, you're here. I'm Brock. I'm the\n"
    .string "Pewter Gym Leader.\p"
    .string "My rock-hard willpower is evident\n"
    .string "even in my Pokémon.\p"
    .string "My Pokémon are all rock hard, and\n"
    .string "possess true-grit determination.\p"
    .string "That's right - my Pokémon are all the\n"
    .string "Rock type!\p"
    .string "Fuhaha! You're going to challenge me\n"
    .string "knowing that you'll lose?\p"
    .string "That's the Trainer's honor that\n"
    .string "compels you to challenge me.\p"
    .string "Fine, then! Show me your best!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RulesExplain::
    .string "However, there is a condition.\p"
    .string "Gym battles require challengers to\n"
    .string "use exactly three Pokémon.\p"
    .string "A true Trainer must show adaptability\n"
    .string "within limits.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to access the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your team?$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockReady::
    .string "I see you've prepared your team.\n"
    .string "Your determination is solid.\p"
    .string "Show me your own rock-hard will!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_Refused::
    .string "Come back when you have exactly\n"
    .string "three Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Discipline is the foundation of\n"
    .string "victory.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_StillNot3::
    .string "You still don't have exactly three\n"
    .string "Pokémon.\p"
    .string "I cannot battle a Trainer who ignores\n"
    .string "the rules.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat::
    .string "I took you for granted, and so I lost.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery1::
    .string "As proof of your victory, I confer on\n"
    .string "you this… the official Pokémon\l"
    .string "League Boulder Badge.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery2::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{PLAYER} received the Boulder Badge\n"
    .string "from Brock!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery3::
    .string "Just having the Boulder Badge makes\n"
    .string "your Pokémon more powerful.\p"
    .string "It also enables the use of the move\n"
    .string "Flash outside of battle.\p"
    .string "Of course, a Pokémon must know the\n"
    .string "move Flash to use it.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "Wait!\n"
    .string "Take this with you.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39FromBrock::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM39\n"
    .string "from Brock.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39::
    .string "A TM, Technical Machine, contains a\n"
    .string "technique for Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Using a TM teaches the move it\n"
    .string "contains to a Pokémon.\p"
    .string "TMs can be used as many times as you\n"
    .string "want.\p"
    .string "So feel free to try different moves\n"
    .string "on different Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Anyways…\n"
    .string "TM39 contains Rock Tomb.\p"
    .string "It hurls boulders at the foe and\n"
    .string "lowers its Speed.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle::
    .string "There are all kinds of Trainers in\n"
    .string "this huge world of ours.\p"
    .string "You appear to be very gifted as a\n"
    .string "Pokémon Trainer.\p"
    .string "So let me make a suggestion.\p"
    .string "Go to the Gym in Cerulean and test\n"
    .string "your abilities.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchIntro::
    .string "I was wondering if I'd have the\n"
    .string "chance to battle you once again.\p"
    .string "Here, at the Gym where your career\n"
    .string "started. Where you earned your\l"
    .string "very first Badge.\p"
    .string "Good to see you again, Trainer.\n"
    .string "Or should I say Champion?\p"
    .string "Fuhaha! You came by at just the\n"
    .string "right time.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchRules::
    .string "The Pokémon League has asked us\n"
    .string "Leaders to test a model of battle.\p"
    .string "They call them Double Battles - two\n"
    .string "Pokémon on each side of the field.\p"
    .string "And you're the perfect person to help\n"
    .string "me master this new format.\p"
    .string "Choose four of your best. I'd like to\n"
    .string "see how far that first step has\l"
    .string "carried you.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to access the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your team?$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchReady::
    .string "A solid foundation.\n"
    .string "Now, break through if you can!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RefusedRematch::
    .string "Return when you've settled on your\n"
    .string "four.\p"
    .string "A Champion should set the example.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_StillNot4::
    .string "Four Pokémon. No more, no less.\p"
    .string "A wall built with the wrong number of\n"
    .string "stones will not hold.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchDefeat::
    .string "Fuhaha! Splendid!\n"
    .string "I'm reduced to debris.\p"
    .string "The one who took a first step here now\n"
    .string "stands harder than stone.\p"
    .string "I could ask for no better proof of how\n"
    .string "far you've come.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchBeforeReward::
    .string "A victory like this deserves more\n"
    .string "than words. Take this with you.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchAfterReward::
    .string "It turns a hard blow into strength\n"
    .string "to strike back.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockRematchPostBattle::
    .string "You've come a long way from that\n"
    .string "first Badge.\p"
    .string "That was a battle worth having.\n"
    .string "Keep climbing, Champion.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostRematch::
    .string "I'll be right here if you need me.\n"
    .string "Take care out there.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis::
    .string "You don't have room for this.$"

PewterCity_Gym_RematchNotEnoughPlaceholder::
    .string "$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_OfferPCRetrieve::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to retrieve your full team?$"

@Last line related to Brock

PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamIntro::
    .string "Stop right there, kid!\p"
    .string "You're ten thousand light-years\n"
    .string "from facing Brock!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamDefeat::
    .string "Darn!\p"
    .string "Light-years isn't time…\n"
    .string "It measures distance!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamPostBattle::
    .string "You're pretty hot.\n"
    .string "…But not as hot as Brock!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetMeTakeYouToTheTop::
    .string "Hiya!\n"
    .string "Do you want to dream big?\p"
    .string "Do you dare to dream of becoming\n"
    .string "the Pokémon champ?\p"
    .string "I'm no Trainer, but I can advise\n"
    .string "you on how to win.\p"
    .string "Let me take you to the top!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetsGetHappening::
    .string "All right!\n"
    .string "Let's get happening!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_TryDifferentPartyOrders::
    .string "The first Pokémon out in a match is\n"
    .string "at the left of the Pokémon List.\p"
    .string "By changing the order of Pokémon,\n"
    .string "you may gain an advantage.\p"
    .string "Try different orders to suit your\n"
    .string "opponent's party.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_ItsFreeLetsGetHappening::
    .string "It's a free service!\n"
    .string "Let's get happening!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_YoureChampMaterial::
    .string "Just as I thought!\n"
    .string "You're Pokémon champ material!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "Pewter Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Brock\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "Pewter Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Brock\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"
